{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "lesson",
  "id": "hakodate_l01",
  "number": 2,
  "title": "Hakodate",
  "status": "final",
  "encounterKanji": [
    "kanji_函",
    "kanji_館",
    "kanji_図",
    "kanji_書",
    "kanji_映",
    "kanji_画",
    "kanji_美",
    "kanji_術"
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "arrival",
      "title": "Welcome to Hakodate",
      "kind": "intro",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{函館|はこだて}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "はこだて"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Hakodate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We travel south through Hokkaido to **Hakodate**, a historic city in southern Hokkaido."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The city is famous for its port, mountain views and historic districts."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now let's look at its name."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "函"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**はこ**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "box / case"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "館"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**かん / やかた**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "building / hall / mansion"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Together:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{函館|はこだて}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**はこだて**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Hakodate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The reading of a place name does not always follow the simple reading of each kanji."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "That is normal."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Place names are one reason Japanese learners gradually build familiarity rather than relying entirely on rules."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inside_hakodate",
      "title": "Inside 函館",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Look inside the name of {函館|はこだて}. Each kanji can be broken into parts - and parts are clues."
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_函",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_館",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_ukebako"
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_shoku"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "函 hides an open box (凵) and 館 carries the food component 食. They hint at what the kanji is about - but the reading はこだて still has to be learned as a name. Components are clues, not magic definitions.",
          "tone": "tip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_02",
      "title": "The Kanji 館",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "館"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "かん"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**kan**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One common meaning is:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "building / hall"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will see it in words such as:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{図書館|としょかん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**としょかん**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "library"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{映画館|えいがかん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**えいがかん**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "movie theater"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{美術館|びじゅつかん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**びじゅつかん**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "art museum"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So when you see:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "館"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "you can begin thinking:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "\"A building or facility.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a useful kanji because it will appear again and again."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_図書館"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_映画館"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_美術館"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_03",
      "title": "Our First Counting Kanji",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now we need one of the most important sets of kanji in Japanese."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{一|いち} {二|に} {三|さん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{一|いち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**いち**\none"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二|に}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**に**\ntwo"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{三|さん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**さん**\nthree"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "These are among the simplest kanji to recognize because their shapes reflect the numbers they represent."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{一|いち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "one line"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二|に}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "two lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{三|さん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "three lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a good example of how the shape of a kanji can sometimes help you remember it."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_一",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_二",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_三",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_04",
      "title": "Four to Six",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{四|よん} {五|ご} {六|ろく}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{四|よん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**よん / し**\nfour"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{五|ご}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ご**\nfive"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{六|ろく}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ろく**\nsix"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For beginners:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Usually learn:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**よん**"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ご**"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ろく**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Some numbers have multiple readings. We will learn which forms are useful in different situations."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_四",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_五",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_六",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_05",
      "title": "Seven to Ten",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{七|なな} {八|はち} {九|きゅう} {十|じゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{七|なな}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**なな / しち**\nseven"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{八|はち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**はち**\neight"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{九|きゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**きゅう / く**\nnine"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{十|じゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**じゅう**\nten"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So our first number set is:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "1 — {一|いち} — いち",
            "2 — {二|に} — に",
            "3 — {三|さん} — さん",
            "4 — {四|よん} — よん",
            "5 — {五|ご} — ご",
            "6 — {六|ろく} — ろく",
            "7 — {七|なな} — なな",
            "8 — {八|はち} — はち",
            "9 — {九|きゅう} — きゅう",
            "10 — {十|じゅう} — じゅう"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will use these constantly."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_七",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_八",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_九",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_十",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_06",
      "title": "Numbers Become Words",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Japanese numbers can combine."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{十|じゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**じゅう**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{十一|じゅういち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**じゅういち**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "11"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{十二|じゅうに}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**じゅうに**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "12"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二十|にじゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**にじゅう**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "20"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二十一|にじゅういち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**にじゅういち**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "21"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The structure is logical:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "20 + 1 = 21"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二十|にじゅう}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "20"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{一|いち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "→"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{二十一|にじゅういち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "21"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_07",
      "title": "Simple Sentences",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's use numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "これは{三|さん}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**これは さんです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Kore wa san desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "This is three."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Breakdown:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "これ"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "this"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "は"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "topic marker"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{三|さん}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "three"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "です"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "is"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{四|よん}は{四|よん}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**よんは よんです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Yon wa yon desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Four is four."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This sounds silly, but it teaches an important sentence structure:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "**A は B です。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A is B."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will use this structure constantly."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_hakodate_number"
        },
        {
          "type": "grammarRef",
          "id": "grammar_a_wa_b_desu"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_08",
      "title": "これ / それ / あれ",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Japanese has three useful demonstratives."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "これ"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**kore**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "this"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "それ"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**sore**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "that"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "あれ"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**are**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "that over there"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "これは{五|ご}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**これは ごです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "This is five."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "それは{六|ろく}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**それは ろくです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "That is six."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "あれは{七|なな}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**あれは ななです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "That over there is seven."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_それ"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_あれ"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_09",
      "title": "Hakodate in a Sentence",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{函館|はこだて}は{北海道|ほっかいどう}の{町|まち}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**はこだては ほっかいどうの まちです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Hakodate wa Hokkaidō no machi desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Hakodate is a city in Hokkaido."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Breakdown:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**{函館|はこだて}** — Hakodate\n**は** — topic\n**{北海道|ほっかいどう}** — Hokkaido\n**です** — is"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notice that we are reusing knowledge from Lesson 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is deliberate."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Learning isn't a series of disconnected lessons."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
